language sdl-mvp1-exercise version 0.1.

scenario RecoverUiBaseline.
condition RecoverUiBaselineReady.
condition RecoverUiBaselineContinue.
condition RecoverUiBaselineReject.
outcome RecoverUiBaselineCompleted.
outcome RecoverUiBaselineRejected.
step RecoverUiBaselineResume.
step RecoverUiBaselineStage.
step RecoverUiBaselineCommit.
step RecoverUiBaselineRenderer.
step RecoverUiBaselineFailure.
step RecoverUiBaselineSuccess.

RecoverUiBaseline illustrates InspectConnectionHealth.
RecoverUiBaseline exercises CoherentUiBaseline.
RecoverUiBaseline starts-when RecoverUiBaselineReady.
RecoverUiBaseline starts-at RecoverUiBaselineResume.
RecoverUiBaselineReady describes "A session changes, delivery gap is detected, or typed resume requires a snapshot.".
RecoverUiBaselineContinue describes "The previous operation succeeded and the next step's declared contract preconditions remain true; exact predicates are an executable-language gap.".
RecoverUiBaselineReject describes "Validation, authority, applicability or operation failure prevents continuation; preserve prior valid state and report the specific reason.".
RecoverUiBaselineCompleted describes "The stated design path completed under its explicit obligations; this is not an observed test result.".
RecoverUiBaselineRejected describes "The path terminated without claiming the requested change succeeded; failures remain observable.".
RecoverUiBaseline preserves DistinctSequenceDomains.
RecoverUiBaseline preserves PreserveRepresentationIdentity.
RecoverUiBaselineResume calls RecoverUiSession within BuckingUI.
RecoverUiBaselineResume describes "Sparse source gaps alone are not loss; distinguish actual delivery/session changes.".
RecoverUiBaselineResume proceeds-to RecoverUiBaselineFailure when RecoverUiBaselineReject.
RecoverUiBaselineResume proceeds-to RecoverUiBaselineStage when RecoverUiBaselineContinue.
RecoverUiBaselineStage calls StageRepresentationSnapshot within BuckingUI.
RecoverUiBaselineStage describes "Build shadow revision from coherent snapshot/watermark.".
RecoverUiBaselineStage proceeds-to RecoverUiBaselineFailure when RecoverUiBaselineReject.
RecoverUiBaselineStage proceeds-to RecoverUiBaselineCommit when RecoverUiBaselineContinue.
RecoverUiBaselineCommit calls CommitUiBaseline within BuckingUI.
RecoverUiBaselineCommit describes "Atomically publish verified baseline; apply only later appropriate events.".
RecoverUiBaselineCommit proceeds-to RecoverUiBaselineFailure when RecoverUiBaselineReject.
RecoverUiBaselineCommit proceeds-to RecoverUiBaselineRenderer when RecoverUiBaselineContinue.
RecoverUiBaselineRenderer calls ResyncRenderer within BuckingUI.
RecoverUiBaselineRenderer describes "Resync schema/state without duplicate domain subscriptions.".
RecoverUiBaselineRenderer proceeds-to RecoverUiBaselineFailure when RecoverUiBaselineReject.
RecoverUiBaselineRenderer proceeds-to RecoverUiBaselineSuccess when RecoverUiBaselineContinue.
RecoverUiBaselineFailure finishes RecoverUiBaseline with RecoverUiBaselineRejected.
RecoverUiBaselineSuccess finishes RecoverUiBaseline with RecoverUiBaselineCompleted.
